WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.632
K'a to o yɔrɔ ra, sira dɔ tun bɛ bɔ kongo kɔnɔ ka taga dugu laminikogojanw cɛ ra.

00:00:06.712 --> 00:00:11.769
K'a to dingakɔnɔyɔrɔ la, a kɛra yɔrɔ dɔ ye min sumana ka suma.

00:00:11.849 --> 00:00:18.480
Cɛkɔrɔbaw b'a fɔ ko i man kan ka taga yen i ko i be taga lɔgɔfiyɛ la cogo min na.

00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:21.629
An b'o kɛ dɔɔni dɔɔni ani ni bonya ye.
